    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The 10th occasion of the Asian Hospital Management Awards saw Aga Khan University Hospital win two awards. The Division of Nursing Services won the Gold award in the Innovations and Governance category for its 'Modification in shift working hours for shift employees at Division of Nursing Services - The Aga Khan University Hospital' project.",
